### Trace API — manual request collection (feature 001)
# Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP client.
# Run the requests top-to-bottom: register captures @token for the rest.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@email = you@example.com
@password = correct horse battery staple

### Health (no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Register -> { token, user }
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Capture the token from the register (or login) response
@token = {{register.response.body.token}}

### Login -> { token, user }
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an entry (occurredAt defaults to now)
# @name createEntry
POST {{baseUrl}}/entries
authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "body": "finished the OPNsense base config #network"
}

### Capture the created entry id
@entryId = {{createEntry.response.body.id}}

### Timeline (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/entries
authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Timeline — first page of 1 (use nextCursor for the next page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/entries?limit=1
authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Timeline — include soft-deleted
GET {{baseUrl}}/entries?includeDeleted=true
authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Edit body / backdate occurredAt (createdAt is never mutated)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/entries/{{entryId}}
authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "body": "edited body #network",
  "occurredAt": "2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### Soft-delete (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/entries/{{entryId}}
authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restore
POST {{baseUrl}}/entries/{{entryId}}/restore
authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout (stateless, 204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
authorization: Bearer {{token}}
